A \textit{builder} structure represents the context in which conversion
takes place, appending nodes (\autoref{ir:node}) to the function under
construction.

==building*/
//ir_builder_t//
//prototypes//
//is_top_level//
//ir_open//
//ir_build//
//ir_extend//
//build_constant//
//build_ref//
//build_call//
//build_phi//
